# Personal secret map (template)

Copy this file to `secret-map.local.md` and fill in the values. The copy is
gitignored, so it never leaves this machine. `secret-handling.md` in this directory
holds the rules that use these values.

This file holds locations only: accounts, vaults, item titles, Keychain
services. Never write a secret value in it.

## 1Password accounts

- <account url>, vault `<vault>`: item `<item>` holds `<secret>`. <what consumes it>.

## NuGet restore failure

- Fix: ask the user to run `op signin --account <account url>` in their own terminal.

## Keychain services

- <service>: what it holds, and which script or tool consumes it.
